Solution:
# Definition for singly-linked list.
# class ListNode(object):
#     def __init__(self, x):
#         self.val = x
#         self.next = None

class Solution(object):
    def hasCycle(self, head):
        """
        :type head: ListNode
        :rtype: bool
        """
        slow = head
        fast = head

        # Only advance while 'fast' and 'fast.next' are not None
        while fast and fast.next:
            slow = slow.next
            fast = fast.next.next
            if slow == fast:
                return True

        return False
        

note:
dummy_head is useful but not always

错误是因为你在循环条件里写了 while slow.next and quick.next.next:，当链表长度很小时会出现 quick.next 为 None 的情况，再访问 quick.next.next 就会触发 “NoneType 对象没有属性 ‘next’” 的异常
